<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.9" extension="2014-06-09"/>
    <code code="51847-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Evaluation + Plan note"/>
    <title>Assessment and Plan</title>
    <text><list listType="ordered"><item><content styleCode="Bold">Adult preventive visit completed</content>. Health risk assessment reviewed and a written prevention plan given. Depression screen negative; AUDIT-C 1. [S]<list><item>Next preventive visit in one year.</item></list></item><item><content styleCode="Bold">Meningioma after resection (D32.0)</content>. No symptoms; next surveillance MRI at one year after surgery. Menopausal hormone therapy is not needed, and progestin-containing hormones are avoided without discussion. [S]<list><item>MRI of the brain with gadolinium in April.</item></list></item><item><content styleCode="Bold">Cardiovascular risk</content>. Non-smoker, blood pressure 120/76, no diabetes; last lipid panel more than five years ago. [S]<list><item>Fasting lipid panel ordered; statin decision when the result is back.</item></list></item></list><paragraph>Personalized prevention plan. A written copy was given to the patient. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Status</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Influenza vaccine, 2026-2027</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Inactivated vaccine given today</td></tr><tr><td>Recombinant zoster vaccine</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Dose 1 today; dose 2 in two to six months</td></tr><tr><td>Pneumococcal vaccine</td><td>Completed today</td><td>PCV20 given today; recommended from age 50</td></tr><tr><td>COVID-19 vaccine, 2026-2027</td><td>Due</td><td>Recommended; she will have it at her pharmacy next week</td></tr><tr><td>Hepatitis B vaccine</td><td>Due</td><td>Recommended for adults 19 to 59; to start once the screening result is back</td></tr><tr><td>Tetanus booster</td><td>Up to date</td><td>Tdap six years ago</td></tr><tr><td>Breast cancer screening</td><td>Ordered</td><td>Mammogram every two years from 40 to 74; last one two years ago, normal; booked for next month</td></tr><tr><td>Cervical cancer screening</td><td>Up to date</td><td>HPV test three years ago, negative; next in two years</td></tr><tr><td>Colorectal cancer screening</td><td>Up to date</td><td>Colonoscopy four years ago, normal; next at ten years</td></tr><tr><td>Hepatitis B, hepatitis C, and HIV screening</td><td>Ordered</td><td>One-time screening; no prior result on record; drawn today, results pending</td></tr><tr><td>Cholesterol screening and statin decision</td><td>Ordered</td><td>Fasting lipid panel ordered; risk to be calculated with the result</td></tr><tr><td>Diabetes screening</td><td>Not indicated</td><td>BMI 22.5 without other risk factors; fasting glucose normal this year</td></tr><tr><td>Osteoporosis screening</td><td>Not indicated</td><td>Under 65, with no fracture or other risk factors; levetiracetam does not speed bone loss as older enzyme-inducing seizure medicines do</td></tr><tr><td>Lung cancer screening</td><td>Not indicated</td><td>Never smoker</td></tr><tr><td>Blood pressure screening</td><td>Completed today</td><td>120/76 mmHg</td></tr><tr><td>Depression screening</td><td>Completed today</td><td>PHQ-2 score 0</td></tr><tr><td>Unhealthy alcohol use screening</td><td>Completed today</td><td>AUDIT-C 1, negative; alcohol kept to one drink or less because it can lower the seizure threshold</td></tr><tr><td>Physical activity and diet counseling</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Daily walks, strength exercise twice a week, regular sleep, and calcium and vitamin D from food</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>Immunizations given today: Influenza vaccine, 2026-2027 season; Recombinant zoster vaccine, dose 1 of 2; Pneumococcal conjugate vaccine PCV20 [S]</paragraph><paragraph>Guideline basis: Medicare Preventive Services reference: visit templates, screening cascades, and documentation elements (2026); USPSTF A and B Recommendations (2026); Adult Immunization Schedule by Age (2026)</paragraph><paragraph>Follow-up: Lipid, hepatitis B, hepatitis C, and HIV results by portal message. Mammogram next month. Second zoster dose in two to six months. One-year MRI in April. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.21" extension="2015-08-01"/>
    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with her consent. She named a health care agent and completed a written health care directive today; the agent is recorded in the chart and is not named here. She asked that she be told the full truth about her condition at every stage, and that no one be asked to decide for her while she can decide herself. She wants full treatment for reversible illness, including further surgery if the tumor ever returned, and would not want prolonged life support if she could no longer read, write, or recognize the people she loves. The plan will be revisited yearly. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>
